# Working directory for the golden comparison.
#
# compare.py stages the single-file pipeline run through here instead of a
# system tempdir, for two reasons:
#   * rubocop resolves .rubocop.yml relative to the file it inspects, so a file
#     under /tmp silently got rubocop's DEFAULT config -- which inserted
#     `# frozen_string_literal: true` and shifted every line of the diff
#   * each pipeline stage is left on disk, so a bad pass can be inspected
#     rather than inferred
tmp/
in/
out/
in*/
out*/
